From: Arian <arian@kulmer.hu>
Subject: Handle the Android 17 CaptureResultExtras constructor

toTotalCaptureResult() reflects on the hidden CaptureResultExtras
constructor to translate the MIUI custom result.  Android 17 added
lastCompletedRegularFrameNumber, lastCompletedReprocessFrameNumber,
lastCompletedZslFrameNumber, hasReadoutTimestamp and
readoutTimestamp (13 params), so both the 11-param and the 8-param
lookups failed and the VirtualCameraReprocessor stalled, leaving the
shot pending forever.

Extend the first lookup to the 13-param constructor, fill the new
fields with their neutral values (0 / false), pass the last-completed
frame numbers as Longs and keep the wide constants in registers that
are not array indexes in the fallback path, so the class still
verifies.

